### Variabel dasar — ganti sesuai environment kamu
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8800
@identifier = usergod@sipon.dev
@password = Usergod1234

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### AUTH — register, login, session
### Setiap request yang diberi "# @name <nama>" bisa direferensikan lagi di
### request selanjutnya via {{<nama>.response.body.$.<json.path>}} — token
### dari response login/register otomatis "tersimpan" untuk request berikut,
### tidak perlu copy-paste manual. (Butuh ekstensi REST Client di VS Code.)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Register user baru
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester1",
  "email": "tester1@sipon.dev",
  "password": "Secret123!"
}

### Login — simpan token dari sini untuk dipakai di request-request di bawah.
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{identifier}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.$.data.refresh_token}}

### Cek token tersimpan (opsional, bisa dihapus)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Session bootstrap — pakai token hasil login di atas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/session
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Profil user saat ini
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refresh token — hasil access token baru otomatis ter-update juga
# @name refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout (revoke session token yang sedang dipakai)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### AUTH — password & identity management (butuh token, lihat @accessToken)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Ganti password (wajib kirim password lama)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "current_password": "{{password}}",
  "new_password": "NewSecret456!"
}

### Set password pertama kali (akun yang belum pernah punya password lokal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/auth/set-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "new_password": "NewSecret456!"
}

### Minta OTP verifikasi identity (email/no hp)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/auth/request-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{identifier}}"
}

### Verifikasi OTP identity — ganti "123456" dengan kode asli dari email/SMS/DB
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{identifier}}",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### Lupa password — kirim OTP reset ke email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/auth/password/forgot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{identifier}}"
}

### Reset password pakai OTP — ganti "123456" dengan kode asli dari email/DB
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/auth/password/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{identifier}}",
  "token": "123456",
  "password": "NewSecret456!"
}

### Minta ganti email — OTP dikirim ke email baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/auth/change-email/request
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "new_email": "tester1-new@sipon.dev"
}

### Konfirmasi ganti email — ganti "123456" dengan OTP asli
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/auth/change-email/confirm
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "otp": "123456"
}

### Minta ganti no HP — OTP dikirim ke no baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/auth/change-phone/request
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "new_phone": "081234567890"
}

### Konfirmasi ganti no HP — ganti "123456" dengan OTP asli
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/auth/change-phone/confirm
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "otp": "123456"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### ROLE & PERMISSION (admin) — semua butuh role superadmin/usergod.
### Login pakai @identifier/@password di atas (default: akun bootstrap
### usergod@sipon.dev hasil `make seed-role` / `make seed-all`).
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/role-permission/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Buat role custom baru
# @name createRole
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/role-permission/roles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "editor",
  "display_name": "Editor",
  "role_type": "custom",
  "scope_type": "global",
  "assignable": true
}

@roleId = {{createRole.response.body.$.data.id}}

### Detail role — pakai roleId hasil create di atas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/role-permission/roles/{{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update role
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/role-permission/roles/{{roleId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "display_name": "Editor (updated)"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### PERMISSION per role — permission KEY didefinisikan di kode (constant), tapi
### assignment ke role CUSTOM disimpan di DB & bisa diatur lewat endpoint ini.
### Role SYSTEM (usergod/superadmin/admin/member) menolak assign/revoke di sini
### (409) — permission-nya fixed di internal/domain/role/constant.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Katalog permission key yang valid (dari kode, bukan DB)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/role-permission/permission-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Assign permission ke role custom — pakai roleId hasil create di atas
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/role-permission/roles/{{roleId}}/permissions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "permission_key": "manage_users"
}

### Revoke permission dari role custom
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/role-permission/roles/{{roleId}}/permissions/manage_users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List user-role assignment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/role-permission/user-roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Assign role ke user — ganti user_id dengan ID user target (lihat response register di atas)
# @name assignUserRole
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/role-permission/user-roles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "user_id": "{{register.response.body.$.data.user_id}}",
  "role_id": "{{roleId}}",
  "scope_type": "global"
}

@userRoleId = {{assignUserRole.response.body.$.data.id}}

### Detail user-role
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/role-permission/user-roles/{{userRoleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Nonaktifkan user-role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/role-permission/user-roles/{{userRoleId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Aktifkan lagi user-role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/role-permission/user-roles/{{userRoleId}}/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Hapus user-role
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/role-permission/user-roles/{{userRoleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
